    "A tag is a service name (\"SQS\") or a service and one of its features (\"SQS › FIFO queues\"); a feature tag implies its service, so never add both.",
    "Give each question 1 to 4 tags, most decisive first.",
    "Tag what the question tests: what the correct answer depends on. Not every service the scenario mentions.",
    "Also tag a wrong option only when it is a near-twin the question is built around (SNS FIFO vs SQS FIFO, ElastiCache vs DAX); generic wrong answers get no tag.",
